# Google Voice 分流规则
# 更新时间：2025-10-25
# 适用于 Clash / Surge / Quantumult X 等代理工具

# Google Voice 核心服务
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googlevoice.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,voice.google.com

# 相关客户端 API
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clients6.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clients4.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apis.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleapis.com

# 验证与资源加载
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,accounts.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ssl.gstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gstatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lh3.googleusercontent.com

# 辅助识别与登录
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,googlevoice

# End of list
